200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260723/202607230013259655_1280.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260723/202607230013259655_1280.jpg"> </div><p>名记罗马诺以标志性的“HWG”确认，维拉已经就租借加纳乔与切尔西达成协议。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-23/6a61075ed4347native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">HWG！罗马诺：利雅得新月签萨默维尔达协议，总价可达6500万镑！</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260723/202607230210425049_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260723/202607230210425049_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260723/202607230210425049_720.jpg"> </div><p>罗马诺以标志性的“HWG”确认，利雅得新月签萨默维尔达协议，总价可达6500万镑。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-23/6a611ed981538native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">ESPN：皇马预计罗德里合理转会费6000万欧，担心他的健康或需手术</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260308/69ad55b4d862c.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-s