 center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.33" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.33" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260721/6a5f572033db0.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260721/6a5f572033db0.jpg"> </div><p>《每日邮报》报道，阿根廷队在世界杯上一系列争议行径过后，梅西在英国民众当中的人气大幅下滑。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-22/6a60da1fe099fnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">反驳阴谋论！阿根廷助教：不理解这种没有的事，只是对手比我们强</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260722/6a60dc2752282_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260722/6a60dc2752282.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260722/6a60dc2752282.jpg"> </div><p>西班牙1-0战胜阿根廷夺得世界杯冠军。阿根廷国家队助教阿亚拉接受采访，反驳了外界关于决赛的阴谋论。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-22/6a60d8fbc9eb3native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">英媒：欧足联主席反对世界杯扩军至64队，亚足联主席也表示反对</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260220/69983921a4b14.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align